From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7996: use default timeout for STA_REC, BSS_INFO and GET_MIB_INFO

Combines upstream mt76 commit 461aea7afc68 ("wifi: mt76: mt7996: use the
default timeout for STA_REC and BSS_INFO") with XR1710G patch 134
(5s deadline for MCU_UNI_CMD_GET_MIB_INFO) so only THERMAL and TWT keep
the short 2s timeout.

--- a/mt7996/mcu.c
+++ b/mt7996/mcu.c
@@ -282,9 +282,6 @@ mt7996_mcu_set_timeout(struct mt76_dev *mdev, int cmd)
 	switch (FIELD_GET(__MCU_CMD_FIELD_ID, cmd)) {
 	case MCU_UNI_CMD_THERMAL:
 	case MCU_UNI_CMD_TWT:
-	case MCU_UNI_CMD_GET_MIB_INFO:
-	case MCU_UNI_CMD_STA_REC_UPDATE:
-	case MCU_UNI_CMD_BSS_INFO_UPDATE:
 		mdev->mcu.timeout = 2 * HZ;
 		return;
 	case MCU_UNI_CMD_EFUSE_CTRL:
